From c4a58dd0f40a7ae35553943440fffcb1036e9064 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:47:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(power): preserve Piano power-off charging requests

Mark only the stock charger power_off_mode field before a connected
power-off. The original bootloader otherwise treats USB wakeup as a
normal Android boot. Keep restart and unplugged shutdown unchanged.

Resolve the unique internal-UFS GPT partition, validate the stock format,
and preserve every other byte through one logical-block read-modify-write.
Flush and compare the complete block on readback before device shutdown.

Exercise the real transaction with UML KUnit, including adjacent data,
busy storage, unplugging, repeated requests and I/O failures.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/piano_defconfig        |   1 +
 drivers/power/reset/Kconfig               |  17 ++
 drivers/power/reset/Makefile              |   1 +
 drivers/power/reset/piano-poweroff-test.c | 209 +++++++++++++++
 drivers/power/reset/piano-poweroff.c      | 296 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 524 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/power/reset/piano-poweroff-test.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/power/reset/piano-poweroff.c

